SUMMARY:Book Babies
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T094500
UID:b59f7af823c508a48439ec3fb761cb9d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please a
 dd any additional registrants to your registration if more than one child 
 that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM
  on Wednesday\, June 10th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents
  and on Friday\, June 12th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime
  PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more
  than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering fo
 r future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your r
 egistrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow f
 or those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registratio
 n status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of 
 the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will
  begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be f
 orfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots rem
 ain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants w
 ill not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Ca
 ncellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the
  program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to on
 e session of multiple session programs per week.
