SUMMARY:Family Story Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T103000
UID:04094ea1c10f0e0148c78b666a9c098b@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nBring the whole family to t
 he library for a delightful storytime experience! Perfect for children age
 s 0-12\, this program features engaging stories\, lively songs\, and fun a
 ctivities designed to spark a love of reading and learning. This is a wond
 erful opportunity for families to bond\, build literacy skills\, and creat
 e lasting memories together!Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT 
 need to register. Please add any additional registrants to your registrati
 on if more than one child that will be participating in the program.Regist
 ration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 5th for Manheim Township 
 and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, August 7th for residents of ot
 her municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel
  their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be re
 stricted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’
 s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the sta
 rt of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of
  their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 mi
 nutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other cir
 cumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At thi
 s time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be
  granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the prog
 ram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 mi
 nutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adul
 ts and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged wi
 th your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check
  your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been can
 celled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-story-time-154765
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
