DESCRIPTION:Adults\n\nJoin us for a day on the greens at our 14th Annual H
 it-the-Links Golf Outing this August\, where every swing supports Adamstow
 n Area Library! Whether you're a seasoned golfer or just enjoy a fun day o
 ut\, this is your chance to make a difference while enjoying a beautiful r
 ound of golf. All proceeds go directly toward expanding our library's prog
 rams\, resources\, and services for our community. Gather your foursome\, 
 grab your clubs\, and help us write the next great chapter — one hole at
  a time! Registration and sponsorships are due August 15\, 2026.Tournament
  Day Details:-Registration will begin at 12:30 pm-Shotgun Start will be at
  1:30 pm.-Awards will be at approximately 6:30 pm.-Registration cost inclu
 des meals and refreshments (lunch\, dinner\, snacks\, water\, tea\, soda\,
  and beer)\, a free future round of golf\, driving range\, green fees\, go
 lf & cart\, and prizes & raffle.There will also be a $10\,000 hole-in-one 
 contest and a grand prize contest for a Pebble Beach Golf Package for 2! A
 ll registrations must be submitted online through this link: https://chari
 tygolftoday.com/event?e=26433&ce=b2188b
