SUMMARY:CANCELLED STEM Ice Cream
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T144500
UID:86756df9eec0dbe7d8bf61ba8584aee7@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\n\nJoin us as we learn how to make ice cream -
  the STEM way!  We'll explore different ingredients\, different flavors\, 
 and different ice cream making techniques.  I scream\, you scream\, we'll 
 all be screaming for ice cream! 🍨🍦This program is for kids ages 6 - 
 9 years old. Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions d
 esignated on your registration. Only children in that age range will be ad
 mitted.   Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 5th f
 or Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, August 
 12th for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program – This pro
 gram is intended for children over the age of 6 years who can participate 
 independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth servi
 ces staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.
 *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; however\, a pare
 nt or caregiver must remain in the library for the duration of the progr
 am. Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify th
 at the program has not been cancelled. Library Program Policies No Show 
 – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library
  programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future progra
 ms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at
  least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow those on the wai
 ting list to be notified of their change in registration status. Late Arri
 vals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program 
 to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promp
 tly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to 
 those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regist
 rants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not 
 be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/stem-ice-cream-173945
