X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Wild About Books: Elephants are Excellent!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T173000
UID:7eb2e5d9fe77119e121a59daeebd3c48@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Storytime\, Children\n\nThis monthly program i
 s designed to ignite young imaginations and foster a love for reading by c
 onnecting books with our animal friends. This month we will celebrate Elep
 hants in honor of World Elephant Day! We will read a story or two featurin
 g a friendly elephant\, then enjoy activity stations spotlighting this mon
 th's animal star. Each station will have a craft or fun activity. Whether 
 you're roaring like a lion\, hopping like a kangaroo\, or swimming like a 
 fish\, there's a place for everyone in our wild book jungle! Kids are invi
 ted to wear grey! Ages 5-9.
LOCATION:Ephrata\, EPH 1/2 Multipurpose Room Kitchen Side
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/wild-about-books-elephan
 ts-are-excellent-168873
