X-SOURCE-ID:apostlesucc
X-SOURCE:Church of the Apostles UCC
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T200000
DTSTAMP:20260821T220854
CREATED:20260803T124101Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260803T124101Z
UID:38494-1787684400-1787688000@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:The Brave World of Peace-building for Israelis & Palestinians
DESCRIPTION:On August 25\, Rabbi Paskoff will share reflections from his recent trip to Israel\, his fifth visit since the war began on October 7\, 2023. During his visits\, he has spent time with grassroots organizations bringing Israelis and Palestinians together for peacebuilding\, as well as Israeli human rights organizations. \nJoin Rabbi Paskoff for a Q&A session about what he has learned through these experiences\, with an opportunity to listen\, ask questions\, and learn more about the work being done toward peace and human rights. \nAdvance registration is required for security purposes\, and attendees are encouraged to submit questions in advance. \nWe welcome our congregation and community to join this opportunity for thoughtful conversation and learning.
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/the-brave-world-of-peace-building-for-israelis-palestinians/
LOCATION:Congregation Shaarai Shomayim\, 75 E James St\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Peace-Building-for-Israelis-Palestinians.jpg
END:VEVENT
