BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/local-art-live/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T223000
DTSTAMP:20260821T220925
CREATED:20260803T140018Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T151403Z
UID:10000816-1787853600-1787869800@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Local Art Live!
DESCRIPTION:Thursday August 27th\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nEvent Ticket | $19.30 + Fees \n+$2 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID Required to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n—————————————————\nCome out and enjoy a great night of live music\, artistic expression\, and delicious drinks – highlighting the incredible talent in our backyard! \nFeaturing Local Artists – Axe Limbert\, Supreem And The New Experience\, & Sir Dominique The Prolific One Ft. Swamprat \nAxe Limbert\nAxe Limbert is a boundary-pushing hip hop and pop artist known for his electrifying performances on the saxophone. Blending soulful melodies with infectious beats\, Axe captivates audiences with his unique fusion of genres. With a background in jazz and a love for contemporary sounds\, he brings a fresh perspective to the music scene. Beyond his musical prowess\, Axe is a visionary artist who channels his creativity into every aspect of his work\, from songwriting to stage presence. With a dedication to authenticity and a commitment to pushing artistic boundaries\, Axe Limbert is carving out his own path in the world of music\, one saxophone riff at a time.  \nSupreem And The New Experience\nSupreem and The New Experience is just that\, an “Experience”. This band functions as an extension for the Urban Entertainer: “Supreem Da’ Rezarekta’”. Supreem admires many of the Soul\, Funk\, Rock and Hip-Hop Artist of the past not only for their timeless music\, but for their live performances as well. Supreem feels it’s important to give his fans 110% of himself when he hits the stage and like those Artists he admires they had bands. Supreem and The New Experience is a collective of eclectic musicians that pay homage to their classic musical roots while creating a fresh new sound and a live show that can’t help but to be noticed.  \nSir Dominique The Prolific One FT. SWAMPRAT\nSir Dominique Jordan is a Spoken Word Poet\, award winning Hip Hop Artivist (currently the Central PA Hip Hop Artist of the Year)\, seasoned educator\, and community organizer whom utilizes the tools of storytelling\, poetry\, and music as pathways to healing\, resilience\, and connection. As a performer\, workshop facilitator and professional speaker\, he guides participants to turn vulnerability into creative strength\, using expressive arts to foster self‑empowerment and empathy toward others. \nSWAMPRAT\nSWAMPRAT is a hip hop beatmaker/producer/live performer\, based in the Harrisburg area. SWAMPRAT is mostly known for his live finger-drumming performances (making beats live in real time on his MPC drum machine\, with no loops or backing tracks)\, and often performs live with some of his favorite emcees. He has also branched out into production\, having released an album on vinyl with Emcee/Poet Thunda Khatt\, a split beat tape with ROK10 and a solo beat tape all in the last year\, with several more collaborations with some of his favorite emcees in the works\, including a full length project with Sir Dominique Jordan coming this fall. SWAMPRAT’s live performances are always unique and dynamic\, and you never know who will join him on stage! \nFeaturing Local Vendors – Ajidagba Goodwin\, Forever Changes\, Rachel Hoffman\, Paints By Chelsie\, & Keisha Finnie\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/local-art-live/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/08/Local-Art-Live-August-27-scaled-e1785689243315.jpeg
END:VEVENT
