X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/mullet/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260829T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260829T220000
DTSTAMP:20260821T220925
CREATED:20260212T150307Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513T202627Z
UID:10000776-1788030000-1788040800@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Mullett
DESCRIPTION:Saturday August 29th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $35.70 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $41.20 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n—————————————————\nSince 2010\, Mullett has stood as the nations definitive 80s rock-and-roll powerhouse! This isn’t just a tribute; its a high-voltage time capsule. By fusing iconic -big hair- aesthetics with massive visual production and fanatical attention to sonic detail\, Mullett recreates the arena-rock glory days with unrivaled conviction. From elite corporate events and sold-out theaters to high-stakes casinos and legendary nightclubs\, Mullett possesses the rare ability to command any stage and electrify any audience.  \nThey don’t just play the hits-they embody the era. Fans and critics alike agree: witnessing Mullett is the closest you can get to the raw energy of Bon Jovi\, Def Leppard\, Van Halen\, Journey\, and Motley Crue without needing a Flux Capacitor or tricked-out DeLorean. Grab your spandex\, catch Mullett at a venue near you\, and let the 80s live forever!  \nCheck out Mullett here!\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/mullet/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/01/Band-2025-2-e1771481740968.png
END:VEVENT
