BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-book-club-176853"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Swoon Squad: A Romance TBR Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260831T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260831T200000
UID:3b0b180efc804492e573ccd95a503b43@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSwoon Squad is a romance-cente
 red book club with a twist. Instead of everyone reading the same assigned 
 title\, we choose a monthly trope and invite you to pick any book that fit
 s the theme! Whether you're into sweet contemporary rom-coms\, high-heat h
 istorical reads\, or paranormal romance\, there's a seat for you at our ta
 ble! How it Works: Pick Your Own Adventure: We announce the month's trope\
 , and you choose a book from your own TBR pile or the library shelves that
  features it. Low Pressure\, High Fun: No more scrambling to finish a spec
 ific book you might not even like. Read at your own pace and bring your ho
 nest thoughts! The Discussion: We gather to swap recommendations\, vent ab
 out our favorite (and least favorite) clichés\, and discover new authors 
 through each other's picks.Come ready to share your pick\, discuss the tro
 pes\, and meet fellow romance fans in a comfortable library setting ❤️
 June 29 - ⚔️Enemies to Lovers ⚔️July 27 - 🥰😠Grumpy/Sunshine
 😠🥰August 31 - 🏆Sports Romance🏆September 28 - 📖Academic Roma
 nce📖October 26 - 🧛Paranormal Romance🧛November 30 - 🛏️Forced 
 Proximity🛏️December 28 - 🎁Holiday Romance🎁
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-
 book-club-176853
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
