DESCRIPTION:Community\, Everyone\n\nManheim Township is hosting a two-day 
 collaborative workshop inviting residents\, property owners\, and stakehol
 ders to help shape the future of Manheim Township's historic villages. Thi
 s focused discussion will guide the zoning ordinance rewrite to define the
  long-term character of the Neffsville and Oregon Villages.This particular
  workshop will focus on the Neffsville Village area.Public: Opening Presen
 tation & Site Constraints | 8:30 - 9 AM Public: Neighborhood Visions & Opp
 ortunities | 9 - 10:30 AMStakeholders: Priority Site Design Exploration | 
 11 - 12 PMStakeholders: Public Realm & Placemaking Strategies | 1 - 2 PMPu
 blic: Public Report Out & Open House | 3 - 3:45 PMOn Wednesday\, September
  2nd\, we will focus on the Oregon Village area (Click here to learn more)
 .
