DESCRIPTION:Community\, Everyone\n\nManheim Township is hosting a two-day 
 collaborative workshop inviting residents\, property owners\, and stakehol
 ders to help shape the future of Manheim Township's historic villages. Thi
 s focused discussion will guide the zoning ordinance rewrite to define the
  long-term character of the Neffsville and Oregon Villages.This particular
  workshop will focus on the Oregon Village area.Public: Opening Presentati
 on & Historical Context | 8:30 - 9:15 AM Public: Strengthening the Village
  Core | 9:15 - 10:30 AMStakeholders: Opportunity Site Exploration | 11 - 1
 2 PMStakeholders: Preservation & Growth Strategy | 1 - 2 PMPublic: Public 
 Report Out & Open House | 3 - 3:45 PM
