UID:8d94c08056741560920727da3fb01509@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Community\, Music\, Storytime\, Toddlers\, Chi
 ldren\n\nIf you realize you can't make it to Story Time after registering\
 , please inform the library by emailing at emartin@manheimlibrary.org or c
 all the front desk at (717)665-6700 Ext. 4200 if it's less than 24 hours n
 otice. Please let us know as soon as you can because we often have a waitl
 ist\, and we want everyone to get the chance to participate if possible.We
 lcome to Family Story Time at the Manheim Community Library!You will find 
 us in the Breakout Room of the Kreider Farms Cultural Center. Please join 
 us for stories\, crafts\, and activities!This program contains crafts that
  may be new or difficult for toddlers\, but we encourage you to try it! Th
 ey may surprise you. We attempt new motor skills often and encourage paren
 ts to help or step back as much as they are comfortable.Family Story Time 
 allows you to register for multiple dates at the same time. Please registe
 r for any day you plan to attend. Only children should be registered. No p
 arents should be registered. This gives me an idea of how many chairs/tabl
 es\, as well as supplies. Drop-offs will not be permitted\, and registrati
 on is required.Please ALWAYS put a phone number for us to contact you for 
 any last-minute changes to your registration status\, like being off the w
 aitlist\, or any program updates.THANK YOU!!!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Break-out Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/family-story-time-fall-2
 026-196252
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
