  3:30–7:30 PMNetworking Mixer + Food: 5–7 PMWe’re partnering with th
 e Chamber to offer a different kind of networking event. Instead of the us
 ual morning member meeting\, spend the afternoon with us at the Library.Co
 me explore the free business resources available through the Library\, con
 nect with other local business owners and professionals\, meet the Chamber
  team\, and learn more about what Chamber membership has to offer.Already 
