 ople involved\, ask questions\, and see what the Chamber is all about.Not 
 sure if the Chamber is for you? Come anyway! There’s no formal presentat
 ion and no pressure to join.Stay for 15 minutes or spend the whole afterno
 on with us. Grab some food\, make a few connections\, learn something new 
