SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T104500
UID:22df648f010aa44a788e87fd54e97e28@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, September 2nd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter 
 residents and on Friday\, September 4th for residents of other municipalit
 ies.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registra
 tion for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from r
 egistering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please 
 cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the progr
 am to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change i
 n registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to 
 the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The
  program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your s
 pot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry.
  If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, 
 registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the 
 start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children
  to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. 
 Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email pri
 or to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program 
 Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs p
 er week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169383
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
