DESCRIPTION:Business & Career\, Community\, Discussion\, Finance\, Present
 ation\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nUnlock Your Future: Manheim Community 
 Library’s 1st Annual Higher Education Fair.Are you a high school student
  or parent navigating the path to post-secondary education? Join us for an
  all-inclusive\, high-impact evening designed to take the guesswork out of
  the college planning process!Whether you’re just starting your search o
 r preparing to submit applications\, this premier event brings representat
 ives from Elizabethtown College\, F&M\, Thaddeus Stevens\, and Millersvill
 e University—alongside financial experts and admissions counselors—dir
 ectly to you under one roof.Direct Access to Admissions: Meet face-to-face
  with representatives from top local colleges and universities. Ask questi
 ons\, explore academic programs\, discover campus life\, and collect offic
 ial admissions resources.On-Site Application Hub: Ready to take the next s
 tep? Get real-time guidance and complete your official college application
 s directly at the event.Expert Financial Breakdown: Demystify tuition\, sc
 holarships\, and financial aid during a featured presentation by financial
  advisor Anne Seitz Brown RICP®\, CCPS®\, CLTC®\, CDFA®\, BFA™️as 
 she shares smart\, insider strategies to fund your college educationIntera
 ctive Breakout Sessions: Tailor your experience with localized group sessi
 ons covering crucial topics—from writing standout application essays to 
 managing college entrance requirements 4:15 PM - 6:15 PMEvent DetailsLocat
 ion: Manheim Community LibraryAdmission: Free & open to all local high sch
 ool students and families
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/1s-annual-college-night-
 196762
