  of Artificial Intelligence (AI).  We hear about it every day but do we re
 ally know what it is and how it is used?  This session will provide you wi
 th a general understanding of AI and how it impacts our lives on a daily b
 asis. This class is supported by a grant from the OpenAI Foundation. Ages 
 18+.
