DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nAre you a fan of Dungeons & Drago
 ns\, murder mysteries\, or social deduction games like Mafia and Werewolf?
  Join us in the Morgan Center for an evening of deception\, logic\, and st
 rategy as we play Blood on the Clocktower!In this highly interactive\, com
 munity-oriented game\, players are divided into secret teams of good villa
 gers and evil demons. You must use your wits\, converse in secret huddles\
 , and deduce who to trust- and who is lying to your face- before evil take
 s over the village.Whether you are a seasoned tabletop gamer or completely
  new to social deduction games\, all skill levels are welcome! Experienced
  local players will act as the "Storytellers" to guide everyone through th
 e rules and run the game.Registration is required as player slots are stri
 ctly limited to ensure a smooth game. Please register to secure your spot 
 in the circle!
