 burg Campaign could be said is one of Ulysses S. Grant’s greatest campai
 gns\, but realistically they campaign was filled with many doubts\, failed
  attempts\, bravery\, and a will to achieve victory at all costs.Join Colu
 mbia Civil War Historian Cindy Beaston as we dive deep into the Vicksburg 
 Campaign from its start in 1862 to its conclusion in 1863.
