SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260921T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260921T104500
UID:c8e02fefb9d28f93bf9d113bf65dc6a8@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, September 9th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter 
 residents and on Friday\, September 11th for residents of other municipali
 ties.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registr
 ation for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from 
 registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please
  cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the prog
 ram to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change 
 in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to
  the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. Th
 e program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your 
 spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry
 . If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\,
  registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the
  start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and childre
 n to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child.
  Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email pr
 ior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program
  Limits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs 
 per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169384
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
