DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Finance\, Health & Wellness\, Present
 ation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSecure your family’s future and build a last
 ing legacy! Join estate planning specialist Stephen for an engaging\, prac
 tical roadmap to protecting your assets and passing down wealth seamlessly
  across generations.Event HighlightsBuilding Generational Wealth: Discover
  proven strategies to grow\, protect\, and preserve your family's financia
 l foundation for years to come.Mastering Estate Setup: Demystify the estat
 e planning process—from wills and trusts to power of attorney—so you c
 an organize your assets with total confidence.Smart Transfer Strategies: L
 earn the most effective\, tax-efficient methods to pass down your wealth s
 moothy and minimize unnecessary stress for your loved ones.Why You Should 
 Attend Estate planning isn't just for the ultra-wealthy—it’s an essent
 ial tool for anyone who wants to ensure their hard-earned assets protect t
 he people they care about most. Whether you're starting from scratch or re
 fining an existing plan\, this clear\, jargon-free session will give you a
 ctionable steps to take control of your legacy.
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Community Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/estate-finance-planning-
 199216
