BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-book-club-176854"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Swoon Squad: A Romance TBR Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T200000
UID:a08bcaccfcaf7f4d2d35e40bda51acfd@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSwoon Squad is a romance-cente
 red book club with a twist. Instead of everyone reading the same assigned 
 title\, we choose a monthly trope and invite you to pick any book that fit
 s the theme! Whether you're into sweet contemporary rom-coms\, high-heat h
 istorical reads\, or paranormal romance\, there's a seat for you at our ta
 ble! How it Works: Pick Your Own Adventure: We announce the month's trope\
 , and you choose a book from your own TBR pile or the library shelves that
  features it. Low Pressure\, High Fun: No more scrambling to finish a spec
 ific book you might not even like. Read at your own pace and bring your ho
 nest thoughts! The Discussion: We gather to swap recommendations\, vent ab
 out our favorite (and least favorite) clichés\, and discover new authors 
 through each other's picks.Come ready to share your pick\, discuss the tro
 pes\, and meet fellow romance fans in a comfortable library setting ❤️
 June 29 - ⚔️Enemies to Lovers ⚔️July 27 - 🥰😠Grumpy/Sunshine
 😠🥰August 31 - 🏆Sports Romance🏆September 28 - 📖Academic Roma
 nce📖October 26 - 🧛Paranormal Romance🧛November 30 - 🛏️Forced 
 Proximity🛏️December 28 - 🎁Holiday Romance🎁
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-
 book-club-176854
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/cooks-books-el-sabor-de-la-isla-flavor-island-160163"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Cooks & Books: Puerto Rican Cuisine & Seasoning Swap
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T193000
UID:8dbed8fafc0833027e663f41e52b548e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nCooks & B
 ooks celebrates Spanish Heritage Month by diving into the bold\, soulful f
 lavors of Puerto Rico! Whether we’re exploring the traditional staples o
 f the Easy Puerto Rican Cookbook or the modern\, mainland-meets-island rec
 ipes of Diasporican\, it’s all about the 'holy trinity' of garlic\, pepp
 ers\, and onions. Come for the sofrito\, stay for the stories\, and discov
 er why the kitchen is the heart of the Puerto Rican home!Bonus Activity: S
 pice & Seasoning Swap! Bring a spice\, seasoning blend\, or favorite condi
 ment to trade with fellow home cooks. (Please bring your own packaging or 
 containers for swap items!)🍽️Cooks & Books is a welcoming space for a
 nyone who loves food and cooking. Bring a dish inspired by Puerto Rican cu
 isine\, your own place setting and serving utensils\, and a friend to join
  the conversation!Requirements: Attendees should be 14 years of age or old
 er. Vegan and vegetarian recipes are always welcome.Supplies: Please bring
  your own serving utensils\, place setting\, to-go container\, and beverag
 e.Cost: The event is free\, but reservations are required!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/cooks-books-el-sabor-de-
 la-isla-flavor-island-160163
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
