BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/vitamin-string-quartet-girl-named-tom-the-crazy-ordinary-world-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T193000
DTSTAMP:20260817T184950Z
CREATED:20260520T133017Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260817T184950Z
UID:10001930-1791574200-1791574200@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Vitamin String Quartet & Girl Named Tom: The Crazy Ordinary World Tour
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $49 $59 $69 \nThis fall\, the world-renowned ensemble Vitamin String Quartet joins forces with the captivating harmonies of acclaimed vocal trio Girl Named Tom to bring their genre-defying arrangements to stages across the US. Known for transforming pop and rock anthems into virtuosic instrumentals\, and fresh off Season 4 in Netflix’s hit series Bridgerton\, VSQ will team up with Girl Named Tom\, whose breathtaking harmonies and heartfelt songwriting won The Voice in 2021 and have solidified their status as one of the leading lights in new American Folk Music. Enjoy music-making at its highest level\, with reimagined classics and modern hits\, stunning performances\, and unforgettable collaborative moments. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind concert experience. \nVSQ & GNT VIP Soundcheck Experience $149 \nIncludes: \n\nOne (1) premium reserved\nAccess to an intimate pre-show soundcheck by VSQ and Girl Named Tom\nMeet & greet hang with both bands\nGroup photo with both bands\nCommemorative VIP laminate and lanyard\nFirst access merch shopping\nEarly entry into the venue\n\nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/vitamin-string-quartet-girl-named-tom-the-crazy-ordinary-world-tour/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/VSQGNT-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
