DESCRIPTION:Slime Workshop Series!\nJoin us for a 30 minute facilitated workshop where participants will create their own themed slime while learning how a few simple ingredients come together to make this stretchy- squishy favorite. Workshops will take place twice each scheduled day\, so choose the time that works best for you! \nTickets on sale soon\, so save the date!\nRequired Age: 6+\nWorkshop Fee: $9 per participant\nCapacity: 24 participants per session \nPlease Note: A paid workshop ticket is required for each participant. \nAdmission is required and Workshop fees are separate from admission and are not included with any admission type or program. Please plan to either purchase timed entry tickets\, purchase tickets at the door\, or use one of our free admission programs. \nAdvance registration is recommended\, as space is limited to 24 participants per session. \nMembers: don’t forget to sign in to get your 10% member discount!
