  designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on t
 he wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may 
 be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted t
 o enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – 
 This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to 
 attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Can
 cellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the 
 program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to one
  session of multiple session programs per week.
