DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nBYOF – bring your own flashlight to 
 this story time! As the sun sets\, we'll gather outside the library for a 
 slightly spooky (never scary!) story time. It will be a time filled with d
 elightful Halloween tales\, glowing fun and flashlight games. Each child w
 ill receive a glow bracelet to help light up the night as we celebrate the
  magic of the season together. Costumes or Halloween pjs are welcome\, and
  all ages are invited to enjoy this cozy evening of stories\, laughter and
  Halloween fun! Ages 5-9.
