DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nBest fo
 r older\, interested teens and adults. Please register every person in you
 r party.Are you brave enough to explore the haunted corners of Lancaster C
 ounty? Join local historian Adam Zurn for an evening of eerie legends\, my
 sterious happenings\, and true tales of the unexplained. This free event p
 romises a thrilling blend of history and the supernatural that will leave 
 you glancing over your shoulder on the walk back to your car. The presenta
 tion combines historical research\, eyewitness accounts\, and local folklo
 re to reveal how the past still echoes through the present.
