DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T104500
UID:3599b3dc82247b44edefe689c85d4d92@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (For
  safety reasons\, children must not be younger than 18 months or older tha
 n 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is required)Adults attendi
 ng with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additiona
 l registrants to your registration if more than one child that will be par
 ticipating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 October 7th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday
 \, October 9th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo 
 Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 libr
 ary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future pro
 grams for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations
  at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on 
 the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Lat
 e Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program 
 to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promp
 tly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to 
 those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regist
 rants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be p
 ermitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying A
 dults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Pleas
 e plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be per
 mitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify
  that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limi
 ted to one session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-169428
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
