X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mtpl-plant-swap-197076"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:MTPL Plant Swap!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T180000
UID:2157eca245103f3ff3b7a7486cec5a8a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🌱 MANHEIM TOWNSHIP PUBLIC L
 IBRARY PLANT SWAP & GARDENING PROGRAM 🌱Whether you’re a seasoned plan
 t parent or just looking to grow your collection\, join us at the Manheim 
 Township Public Library for a double dose of plant fun! Start by refreshin
 g your garden at our community plant swap\, and stay right after for an ex
 citing\, free gardening program to learn the secrets hidden in your landsc
 ape.How the Swap Works:Give One\, Get One: Bring a healthy\, pest-free pla
 nt (potted or a rooted cutting in a jar) to the swap table and take home a
  new green friend! 🌿🪴Share the Knowledge: Feel free to attach care i
 nstructions or ID tags so the new owner knows how to help their new sprout
  thrive.Branch Out: Meet fellow local gardeners and swap expert tips along
  with your plants!Bonus Program Right After! Stick around immediately foll
 owing the swap for The Treachery of Botany: Poisonous Garden Plants\, a fr
 ee\, eye-opening session on identifying and managing hidden plant hazards 
 in your landscape.Bring a plant\, pick up a new favorite\, and gain the kn
 ow-how to keep your botanical sanctuary thriving and safe!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mtpl-plant-swap-197076
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
