UID:42eaff6ba91ccc769f0505f514dd9b4e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe sirens soun
 d\, the news breaks\, and there’s a zombie at the door... 🚨🧟‍♂
 ️ What’s your next move?!Could you survive the outbreak? Join us for a
 n interactive\, high-stakes evening with Fire Chief Scott Little and the L
 ancaster County Emergency Management Office to find out!What to expect: 
 🧠 Step-by-step "What Would You Do?" survival challenges 🎒 How to bui
 ld the ultimate disaster go-bag 📱 Tips to navigate communication blacko
 uts & power outages 🏠 Real-world home safety & family disaster planning
 Test your wits against the undead while picking up vital\, real-life skill
 s for local storms and emergencies! ⚡🌧️
