  the halls\, brown paper packages tied up with string\, and SO MUCH STRESS
 . Professional Organizer Mara Pritchard of The Beautiful Sort is here to h
 elp. During her presentation\, Mara will discuss a simple approach to the 
 holidays. She will teach that by focusing on your family’s values and pr
 ioritizing joy\, you can reclaim the holiday season. Join us in a conversa
 tion about how this can happen. Topics of discussion include decorating\, 
 gift giving\, hosting\, and kids. Attendees will learn concrete steps to s
 implifying the season and getting their six geese a-laying in a row. Ages 
