SUMMARY:2830 - Fresh Pasta: Autumn Comfort Flavors
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the cozy flavors of autumn with a hands-on pasta-making workshop led by Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya. In this seasonal class\, you will learn to craft silky fresh pasta from scratch and transform it into comforting fall-inspired dishes using ingredients like roasted squash\, mushrooms\, and herbs.  \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nFresh Egg Pasta Dough\nButternut Squash Ricotta Ravioli with Brown Butter and Crispy Sage\nRoasted Mushroom Tagliatelle with Thyme Cream Sauce\nAutumn Greens Salad with Apple Cider Vinaigrette\, Toasted Pecans & Goat Cheese
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2830-fresh-pasta-autumn-comfort-flavors/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Seasonal
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/stuffed-pasta--scaled-e1738796899914.jpg
