SUMMARY:2833 - Pie and Pastry Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Pastry Chef Faith Kennedy for a hands-on baking workshop celebrating one of fall’s most beloved desserts. In this class\, you’ll learn the fundamentals of creating tender\, flaky pastry from scratch while mastering techniques for beautifully assembled hand pies\, flavorful fillings\, and bakery-worthy finishes. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian \n\nIndividual Maple Apple Hand Pies\nHomemade Pie Dough\nBrown Butter Streusel\nCinnamon Vanilla Glaze\nSalted Caramel Dipping Sauce
