SUMMARY:2834 - Thanksgiving on the Smoker 
DESCRIPTION:Take your Thanksgiving table to the next level by learning how to create a holiday feast with incredible wood-fired flavor. In this hands-on class\, Chef Jeremy Losinno will share the techniques behind perfectly smoked turkey\, flavorful homemade sauces\, and seasonal side dishes that will impress family and friends all season long.  \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. Gluten Free \n\nSmoked Turkey Breast\nMaple Cranberry BBQ Sauce\nWarm Apple-Cabbage Slaw with Brown Butter Vinaigrette\nGarlic Herb Fondant Potatoes
