DESCRIPTION:Community\, Health & Wellness\, Storytime\, Toddlers\, Childre
 n\n\nThis is a children’s cooking class where we will make simple snack 
 foods in the theme of Thanksgiving. We will be learning low-level kitchen 
 skills like the importance of washing our hands\, how to set the table hel
 pfully\, and cleaning up after ourselves appropriately. Play food will als
 o be on hand for practice and fun! We will read stories about families of 
 all kinds and how they may celebrate Thanksgiving. Caregivers\, please com
 e prepared to meet your child where they are and ready to entertain all th
 eir recipes! Ages 3-6.
