DESCRIPTION:Save the date for BubbleMania: Science\, Art\, Comedy with Casey Carle\nPresented by ABA Centers of Pennsylvania \nCasey Carle\, comic bubbleologist will perform his amazing one-man show BubbleMania! This show features giant floating spheres\, soap-film “serpents\,” bouncing bubbles\, cube bubbles\, the Crystal Ball; the spinning Bubble Spacecraft\, and so much more! \nNovember 27 and November 28\, 2026 \nShowtimes and ticketing information to follow!
