SUMMARY:2841 - Kids Holiday Baking Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive Kids Holiday Baking Workshop with Chef Gwen Eberly! In this fun-filled class\, children will dive into the holiday spirit by baking and decorating treats. Under Chef Gwen’s expert guidance\, they’ll enjoy mixing\, rolling\, and frosting their way to creating delicious holiday goodies. It’s a hands-on experience that promises to bring smiles and sweet memories to the holiday season. \nHands on. Ages 7-14. Vegetarian \n\nHoliday Sugar Cookies\nJammy Almond Thumbprint Cookies\nChocolate Chunk Blondies
