SUMMARY:2842 - Challah and Babka Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 3-hour masterclass where you’ll learn to bake two beloved holiday breads: Challah and Babka. In this hands-on class\, you’ll explore the techniques for crafting these traditional yeasty treats from scratch. By the end of the class\, you’ll take home a freshly baked Chocolate Babka and Braided Challah\, perfect for sharing with family and friends. \nHand on. BYOB. Vegetarian. Ages 16 and up.  \n\nChallah and Babka Dough\nBraiding Techniques\nTraditional Challah\nChocolate Babka
