UID:event_vtdfztyjcqbqb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020922Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T120000
SUMMARY:Creative Release Open Studio Saturday
DESCRIPTION:The Creative House of Lancaster\n#### ***A Place to Make Art T
 ogether***\n\n**When:** Every Other Saturday from 10am - 12pm\n**Where:** 
 [The Candy Factory](https://share.google/nqC7VtCS6IcDeBRyg)\n**Cost:** Fre
 e & Open to the Public\n**Ages:** All Ages\n\n**Upcoming Dates**\nJuly 11\
 , July 25\, Aug 8\, Aug 22\, Sept 5\, Sept 19\, Oct 3\, Oct 17\, Oct 31\, 
 Nov 14\, Nov 28\, Dec 9\, Dec 23\n\n*Do you have creative aspirations but 
 never seem to make the time? Do you want the companionship of others to ov
 ercome your creative blocks and “just do it”?*\n\nCreative Release pro
 vides spaces and resources that make artmaking accessible. Whether you’r
 e an experienced artist or just looking to explore your creative side\, Cr
 eative Release is a safe place to explore your ideas with others. Bring yo
 ur ongoing projects or use the art materials available.\n\nDon't have a pr
 oject at the moment? That's just fine. I’ll have materials to share.\n**
 What to Expect:**\n\n* A welcoming\, inclusive environment\n* A variety of
  art materials to experiment with\n* Demonstrations on how to use differen
 t art materials\n* The opportunity to work on your personal projects\n* Th
 e chance to meet and collaborate with fellow creatives\n* A moment to rela
 x\, create\, and escape the usual routine\n\n**Who Should Join?**\nAnyone 
 and everyone! Bring an idea for a card\, a knitting pattern you’ve been 
 wanting to try\, a shirt that needs mending\, or a full-on canvas and pain
 ts. Most of all\, bring your lovely self! We believe in the power of commu
 nity and creativity.\n\n[Event Link](https://www.jodavis.art/community-eve
 nts-1/creative-release)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-creative-house-of-lancaster/event
 s/vtdfztyjcqbqb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260703T133334Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260703T133334Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancastersciencefactory": "https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/girl-scout-badge-workshops-robotics/2026-12-12/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancastersciencefactory
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Science Factory
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T160000
DTSTAMP:20260821T220859
CREATED:20260804T141923Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T142514Z
UID:10003266-1797082200-1797091200@lancastersciencefactory.org
SUMMARY:Girl Scout Badge Workshops (Robotics)
DESCRIPTION:Badge Workshops for Daisies through Juniors\nThe Lancaster Science Factory is pleased to offer an expanded menu of Girl Scout workshops designed to educate\, challenge\, and empower scouts while completing badge requirements. \nWorkshops are 1 hour unless otherwise noted. Register a single scout or the whole troop for upcoming workshops listed below. \n  \nRobotics Badge Workshops\nLearn all about robotics with our hands-on Robotics Badge workshops! All workshops cover the Robotics Badge 1 for each troop level. \nRobotics workshops will be offered on the following dates: \nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \nSaturday\, December 12\, 2026\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \nSaturday\, March 20\, 2027\n–Daisies and Brownies from 1:30-2:30 pm (register here) \n–Juniors from 3-4 pm (register here) \n  \nCan’t make it to a scheduled workshop? Reach out to Megan Stoltzfus at mstoltzfus@tlsf.org to schedule a private workshop. Availability is limited for private workshops\, so we recommend scheduling ahead by a minimum of 1-2 months if possible.\nProgram attendance\, cancellation\, and refund policy.\n\nCancellations (by the registrant) received less than one week prior to the workshop will be subject to a refund of 1/2 of the total registration cost for that workshop. Cancellations received prior to that shall receive a full refund.\nWorkshops canceled by the Lancaster Science Factory for ANY reason will be refunded fully.\n\n 
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/girl-scout-badge-workshops-robotics/2026-12-12/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Girl-Scout-Badge-Workshops-1920-x-1080-px.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
END:VEVENT
